  "description": "House architecture rules as xUnit tests on ArchUnitNET. PAT-LAYER-1: Domain depends on no other layer of the service, Application only on Domain, Infrastructure not on Web. PAT-REVIEW-15: every *Request has a validator (FastEndpoints, or MVC via ControllerRequestValidatorRules). PAT-REVIEW-12: TenantFilterRules checks every TenantId entity has a query filter. QUAL-ADOPT-1: ReimplementedPackageRules fails when a service re-implements a shared package. C2: RepositoryCompositionRules fails when a repository takes another repository. C3: ControllerRouteRules fails when two MVC controllers share a class-level route. REPO-ONLY-1: RepositoryOnlyDatabaseRules fails when a class not named *Repository or *Store takes a DbContext. A service adds one class HouseArchitectureTests : HouseRules<TAnyTypeInWebAssembly>.",
